# Normalise line endings so files that must run inside Linux containers (the
# Maven wrapper, shell scripts) never pick up CRLF from a Windows checkout —
# see docs/decision-log.md for the incident this fixed (mvnw failed with
# "/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter" inside eclipse-temurin:25-jdk).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg binary
